t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>President Donald J. Trump is delivering an America First surge of manufacturing, energy, agriculture, semiconductor, shipbuilding, and national security investments that are bringing production home, expanding domestic capacity, and locking in American jobs.</strong> These commitments build on the trillions in <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/investments/\">private investment</a> the Trump Administration has secured since taking office — proving that when America puts itself first, results follow.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>As the Administration moves across the country, it is delivering concrete wins for American communities:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>GEORGIA:</strong> Audi is <a href=\"https://www.audi.com/en/press-releases/audi-to-establish-first-us-production-site-in-georgia-investing-4-billion-and-creating-4500-jobs-18420\">investing</a> $4.2 billion to build its first-ever U.S. production site near Macon — a <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-24/volkswagen-plans-new-audi-plant-in-georgia-handing-trump-a-win\">direct result</a> of President Trump’s trade agenda. The plant will create 4,500 jobs and have an annual production capacity of 200,000 vehicles, strengthening American dominance in auto manufacturing. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2114148679351169136\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>FLORIDA:</strong> The Trump Administration is <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2113720027581173884?s=20\">investing</a> $275 million to recruit, hire, and retain at least 5,000 new nurses in elder care facilities nationwide, expanding the workforce that serves American seniors. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2113720027581173884?s=20\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>IOWA:</strong> The Trump Administration is <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/articles/energy-department-use-defense-production-act-funding-restart-american-refinery-and-expand\">invoking</a> the Defense Production Act to release $150 million to expand U.S. refining capacity — boosting domestic production of diesel and gasoline to strengthen energy security and lower costs. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2113437844811165855?s=20\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NEBRASKA:</strong> The Trump Administration is <a href=\"https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/press-releases/2026/10/22/trump-administration-announces-major-investment-american-fertilizer-manufacturing-strengthen\">investing</a> $1.3 billion in domestic fertilizer manufacturing, with TalusAg <a href=\"https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/press-releases/2026/10/22/trump-administration-announces-major-investment-american-fertilizer-manufacturing-strengthen#:~:text=TalusAg%20%E2%80%93%20Iowa%2C%20Kentucky,depend%20on%20it.\">opening</a> two facilities in Nebraska to deliver lower-cost, American-made fertilizer to farmers. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2113304731863142865?s=20\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NORTH CAROLINA:</strong> The Trump Administration is <a href=\"https://www.wolfspeed.com/company/news-events/news/wolfspeed-announces-conditional-30-year-loan-commitment-from-us-department-of-war-to-advance-domestic-wide-bandgap-supply-chain/\">investing</a> up to $1.5 billion to expand semiconductor production, while Sibelco  <a href=\"https://www.sibelco.com/en/news/sibelco-and-u-s-department-of-commerce-sign-letter-of-intent-for-up-to-56-million-in-chips-act-funding-to-advance-high-purity-quartz-innovation-for-semiconductor-manufacturing-in-the-united-states\">expands</a> production of high-purity quartz and related materials essential to semiconductors in Mitchell County — advancing America’s semiconductor supply chain. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2112708953125577026\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>KANSAS:</strong> The Trump Administration is <a href=\"https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/press-releases/2026/10/19/trump-administration-announces-8-billion-harvest-fuel-relief-program\">launching</a> the Harvest Fuel Relief Program, providing farmers with up to $8 billion in support to offset elevated diesel costs during the current harvest season and protect American agriculture. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2112353730041422330?s=20\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>MONTANA:</strong> The Department of War is <a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/trump-announces-montana-super-range-midterm-rally-pentagon-test-advanced-war-technology\">establishing</a> a new super range for testing advanced weapons and technologies — including autonomous weapons, space and electronic warfare capabilities, supersonics, and hypersonics — to ensure American military superiority. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2110558543866732889\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>KENTUCKY:</strong> The Department of War is <a href=\"https://www.war.gov/News/Releases/Release/Article/4628105/department-of-wars-office-of-strategic-capital-signs-80-million-conditional-loa/\">advancing</a> an $80 million investment to revitalize pharmaceutical manufacturing with Antheia at a facility in Winchester, restoring critical drug production to American soil. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2111535296244326857\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>ALASKA:</strong> Taiwan is <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/trump-alaska-sullivan-midterm-election-0542aaa0e516c1c6057a2f13e9163b3f#:~:text=During%20Tuesday%E2%80%99s%20rally,provide%20further%20details.\">investing</a> <a href=\"https://alaskapublic.org/news/politics/elections/2026-10-13/trump-rally-brings-pardons-promises-and-endorsements-to-wasilla#:~:text=agreed%20to%20invest-,%244.4%20billion,-.%20Taiwan%20signed%20a\">$4.4 billion</a> in Alaska’s mega-gas project, while the Federal Communications Commission is <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/trump-alaska-sullivan-midterm-election-0542aaa0e516c1c6057a2f13e9163b3f#:~:text=Trump%20also%20said,on%20certain%20vehicles.\">investing</a> an additional $162 million to expand high-speed internet across the state. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2110186587036537208?s=20\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>OHIO:</strong> Cleveland will be the <a href=\"https://thehill.com/newsletters/defense-national-security/6146728-cleveland-to-be-home-of-next-submarine-repair-center/\">home</a> of the new U.S. Submarine Component Repair Center, strengthening America’s undersea naval industrial base. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2109801412066443765\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>MARYLAND:</strong> The Navy and Anduril are <a href=\"https://www.anduril.com/news/anduril-u-s-navy-invest-usd6-6-billion-to-expand-america-s-submarine-industrial-base\">investing</a> $6.6 billion to build Arsenal-2, a new software-defined shipyard in Baltimore — the largest new American shipbuilding push in generations. <em>(</em><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2107566035507593450\"><em>Watch</em></a><em>)</em></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>These investments demonstrate the Trump Effect in action: bringing jobs and production home, supporting American workers and farmers, strengthening energy and national security, and expanding the skilled workforce America needs.</strong> The Trump Administration will continue delivering results that rebuild American industry and put America First.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/from-coast-to-coast-president-trump-is-putting-american-industry-back-on-the-map/\">From Coast to Coast, President Trump Is Putting American Industry Back on the Map</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
